    "columns": 1,
    "hidden": false,
    "content": "<p>Senior Full Stack Engineer with 6+ years of experience building high-traffic distributed systems, scalable APIs, and cross-platform applications. Proven impact: optimised systems handling 1200+ req/s at 99.9% uptime, delivered £250k+ in annual cost savings, and led teams of up to 15 engineers. Deep expertise in Node.js/TypeScript backends, React frontends, cloud-native infrastructure (AWS/GCP/K8s), and GraphQL at scale. Background in product management drives a focus on shipping reliable systems that solve real business problems.</p>"
